DPHC-PointPillars

This software includes and modifies OpenPCDet:
https://github.com/open-mmlab/OpenPCDet

OpenPCDet is distributed under Apache License 2.0. The original LICENSE and
upstream Git history are retained. DPHC modifications include density-aware
pillar encoding, a full-resolution pedestrian context branch, frozen-main
two-stage training and class-selective prediction fusion.
